WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Once, a small seed slept in the dark earth.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
It dreamed of a sky it had never seen.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
One spring morning, the rain whispered: wake up.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The seed pushed a tiny green hand upward.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The soil was heavy, and the dark was wide.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
But it climbed, one slow breath at a time.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Until one day, the darkness cracked open.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
And light poured over the little sprout.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The sky was real. It had been worth the climb.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
And the seed became a tree that touched the wind.
